#: src/adding-and-removing-environment-variables.md:1
msgid "Adding and Removing Environment Variables"
msgstr ""

#: src/adding-and-removing-environment-variables.md:3
msgid ""
"By default, environment variables which are exported or unexported in the "
"`justfile` are included in the cache key, and environment variables exported "
"outside the `justfile` and inherited by `just` are not included."
msgstr ""

#: src/adding-and-removing-environment-variables.md:7
msgid ""
"Environment variables can be added or removed from the cache key using "
"`[cache(environment = EXPRESSION)]`<sup>1.59.0</sup>."
msgstr ""

#: src/adding-and-removing-environment-variables.md:10
msgid ""
